<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on UK water company basket. [CORRECTED 15:09 GMT]</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on UK water company basket. [CORRECTED 15:09 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued one million (corrects from &quot;100 million&quot;) American-style call warrants, on a UK water company basket, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>The basket includes one share each of Thames Water Plc, Anglian Water Plc, United Utilities Plc and Severn Trent Plc.</p>
<p>One warrant refers to one underlying.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    24.0 STG		  ISSUE PRICE  2.71 STG</p>
<p> PREMIUM	   11.3 PCT (BREAK EVEN) GEARING	8.86 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	25.NOV.98		 PAYDATE	06.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  24.0 STG</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
